<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <nav class="flex mb-8 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <%= link_to "Home", root_path, class: "hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors" %>
    <span class="mx-2 text-slate-300">›</span>
    <span class="text-slate-800">Editorial Policy</span>
  </nav>

  <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6">
    Editorial Policy & Data Corrections
  </h1>
  <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-10">
    Our commitments to accuracy, integrity, and how to report errors.
  </p>

  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
    <section class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">1. Editorial Standards</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        VisaSponsorUK provides clear, objective, and up-to-date resources for international job seekers looking for visa-sponsored employment in the United Kingdom.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        All guidance documents, glossary definitions, and FAQ responses are written by our in-house editorial team and are routinely reviewed to reflect changes in UK immigration policy, salary thresholds, and sponsorship guidelines.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">2. Accuracy & Correction Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Because our system relies on automated scripts to parse public PDFs and CSV logs published by the Home Office, parsing errors can occasionally occur.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        If you represent a business listed on our platform and believe that your active routes, rating, or corporate details are displayed incorrectly, please submit a correction request.
      </p>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 bg-slate-50/50">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">How to Submit a Correction</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
          Please email us at <strong>bloomberg490@gmail.com</strong>
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-1">
          <li>Company Name and Companies House Registration Number.</li>
          <li>The URL of the page containing the error.</li>
          <li>A brief description of the required correction (e.g. spelling fix, updating trading name).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
